(7761270, 1285468, 138630, '<td valign="top">Quite lovely and what I liked as much as the tones, lighting, textures, and forms was the (perceived, perhaps) title''s double entendre - to me these shapes remind me of ladies dancing, their full skirts twirling about their bodies so that in the (morning?) light the dried blossoms literally become feminine forms.  Anyway, congratulations on the red.</td>', 'Quite lovely and what I liked as much as the tones, lighting, textures, and forms was the (perceived, perhaps) title''s double entendre - to me these shapes remind me of ladies dancing, their full skirts twirling about their bodies so that in the (morning?) light the dried blossoms literally become feminine forms.  Anyway, congratulations on the red.', '2023-12-22 00:21:48.000000', NULL, 0),
